        "original_id": "7fe8f13c-30e7-5a98-b1f0-3226d5e043ac",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Still Loving You\", Love at First Sting\n- People: Scorpions\n- Topics: song releases, chart performance\n\nFacts:\n- Love at First Sting is the ninth studio album by the German hard rock band Scorpions.\n- In July 1984, Scorpions released \"Still Loving You\" as the second single from Love at First Sting.\n- \"Still Loving You\" is a heavy metal ballad by the German rock band Scorpions.\n- \"Still Loving You\" reached number 64 on the Billboard Hot 100.\n- Love at First Sting contains \"Rock You Like a Hurricane\", \"Still Loving You\", and \"Big City Nights\", which are among Scorpions' most famous songs.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
